  "description": "it is a library that simplifies accessing current session information and implementing rate limiting and duplicate submission prevention in .NET microservice architectures, Version 1.0.3 added support for net8, Version 1.0.4 adds support for .NET 10 and resolves the exception caused by empty string values for int types. Built with a modular architecture, it enables seamless integration into your existing projects. Supported by Patrick.Z, this library streamlines repetitive daily development configurations in .NET applications and takes the heavy lifting off your shoulders.",
